  "description": "Three years ago, Tae-Yang’s boyfriend ended their relationship by announcing his engagement to someone else. Tae-Yang never expected to cross paths with him again, yet while investigating suspicious rumors surrounding the couple, the journalist suddenly finds himself face to face with his ex, Woo Ju-Yeol. Ju-Yeol offers Tae-Yang exclusive information for his reports, but the price is unsettling: Tae-Yang must be at his beck and call for sex, no questions asked.. Determined to expose Ju-Yeol’s darkest secrets, Tae-Yang accepts the deal. What begins as a transaction soon spirals into a dangerous mix of obsession, desire, and revenge.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
